% expect-output: {0.0 0.0 0.0 0.0 setbbox}
% expect-output: {ucache 0.0 0.0 0.0 0.0 setbbox}
% expect-output: {5.0 5.0 5.0 5.0 setbbox 5.0 5.0 moveto}
% Scenario: upath of an empty path is a user path with an all-zero box
% and nothing after setbbox; true asks for ucache first. A lone moveto
% is reported with its point as the box.
newpath false upath ==
true upath ==
5 5 moveto false upath ==
